      "text": "[8:57PM] #Maryland_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nEffortless traffic progression along the service lane, commencing from Anthony and proceeding inward to Maryland intersection, extending to Odo'yalaro and Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way.\n\nUnwavering calm pervades the entirety of Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way.\nUnencumbered traffic flow is along Kodesoh Road, Oba Akran Road/Bridge, Local Airport Road/Bridge, Oba Akinjobi Way and Ikeja G.R.A.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
