      "text": "[9:03PM] #OguduAlapere #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood movement from Gbagada Bridge to Olopomeji.\nSteady movement from Carwash to Ifako due to ongoing construction work on the damaged expansion joint at Ifako Bridge.\nSmooth drive from Ifako Bridge to Ogudu, NNPC Filling Station, Tollgate, and Otedola inward Berger.\nGood return journey from Otedola to Tollgate, Alapere, and Carwash inward Island.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
